                                <strong>Ato  Mustefa Shahecho Hussen</strong>
                                  <br/>
                                <strong>Bunna Bank S.c</strong>
                                  <br/>

                                  <strong>Addis Ababa</strong>
                                <br/>
                                <strong>Dear Ato Mustefa,</strong>
                            </div>
                             </div>
                        <h6 class="text-center"><strong><u>Subject: - Promotion</u></strong></h6>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Considering your experience and remarkable contribution to the Bank, I am pleased to inform you that you are promoted to the post of <strong>Branch Manager –I </strong>  with Job Grade <strong>–XII </strong> and assigned at <strong>Hilal Branch </strong>effective the date you assume your new position.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Commencing the date, you assume the new position, your monthly gross salary is raised to   <strong>Birr 42,348.00 (Forty-Two Thousand Three Hundred Forty-Eight) </strong> and entitlement of other benefits attached for the job grade.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Your assignment to this post is indeed a clear indication of the Bank’s confidence in you to carry out your duties and responsibilities to its entire satisfaction with the expected standard of the Bank. </p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>By copy of this letter, <strong>Main Branch</strong> is advised to release <strong>Ato Mustefa Shahecho</strong> and forward Payroll related information, Outstanding loan Account details, Leave status, and any other necessary information to <strong>Hilal Branch, South Addis Ababa District, and Talent Management Directorate.</strong></p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>I hope you will capitalize on your achievement to date and look forward to enhanced performance of the   <strong>Hilal Branch</strong> in all the responsibility areas bestowed upon you.</p>
                        <br/>
                    </div>
                <div>
                               <div class="row mt32">
                                   <br/>
